---
import GuideLayout from '../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout title="MW4 DMZ Guide Hub" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p>本页是 Modern Warfare 4（MW4）<strong>DMZ</strong> 专题导览：说明本站覆盖哪些机制与查询页，并链到发售 / 平台 / 模式入口。</p>
    <p>官方将 DMZ 定位为 extraction 体验（Hajin 部署、战利品与撤离）；FOB 为部署前后的指挥中枢；Traits 为 Operator 长期成长。<code>confirmed</code>（口径）· Sources <a href="#source-1">[1]</a><a href="#source-2">[2]</a></p>
    <p>适用：想从「一词一页」入口进入钥匙、FOB、特质、代码等查询的读者。</p>
    <p><strong>不</strong>覆盖：可缩放全图首页、日更情报站、未独立核实的传闻定论。</p>
  </div>
  <ol slot="how-to">
    <li>先按意图选下方入口（机制查询 → 点位流程 → 发售/平台/模式）。</li>
    <li>表页上的 <code>Status</code> 列：<code>confirmed</code> 可读作已核；<code>reported</code> 仅作线索。</li>
    <li>导览卡不写具体游戏数值；数值只出现在各子页表内，且须带来源。</li>
  </ol>
  <div slot="body">
    <h3>机制与查询（B · P0）</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>机制与查询入口；已核内容与查询边界</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">入口</th><th scope="col">Slug</th><th scope="col">一句话</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th><th scope="col">Sources</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Keys</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-keys/">/mw4-dmz-keys/</a></td><td>DMZ 钥匙列表与点位关联（可筛表）</td><td>机制/附录钥名已有 <code>confirmed</code> 行；Location/Grid 多空；逐钥满表未做</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-8">[8]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>FOB</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-fob/">/mw4-dmz-fob/</a></td><td>Forward Operating Base 解锁与用途表</td><td>已有 <code>confirmed</code> 站点表行可用（官方 Part 2）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-8">[8]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Best traits</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-best-traits/">/mw4-dmz-best-traits/</a></td><td>特质 / 天赋树筛选表</td><td>已有 <code>confirmed</code> 结构 + Major Trait 表行可用（官方 Part 2）；Cost 列空；非官方「最佳」排名</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-8">[8]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Stranded codes</td><td><a href="/mw4-stranded-codes/">/mw4-stranded-codes/</a></td><td>Stranded 相关代码表（严格分层）</td><td>边界说明：战役 Mission 10 键盘码 / 非 DMZ 钥 / 无官方码表 → 代码不得 <code>confirmed</code>；表保持空</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-8">[8]</a></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>点位与流程（B · P1，本批仅链占位）</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>点位与流程入口（P1）</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">入口</th><th scope="col">Slug</th><th scope="col">说明</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Police Station</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-police-station/">/mw4-dmz-police-station/</a></td><td>单点位页（P1，正文另批）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Radio Tower</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-radio-tower/">/mw4-dmz-radio-tower/</a></td><td>单点位页（P1，正文另批）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Solo</td><td><a href="/mw4-dmz-solo/">/mw4-dmz-solo/</a></td><td>单人流程 + FAQ（P1）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Is DMZ free?</td><td><a href="/is-dmz-free-in-mw4/">/is-dmz-free-in-mw4/</a></td><td>短答 FAQ（P1）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Patch notes</td><td><a href="/mw4-patch-notes/">/mw4-patch-notes/</a></td><td>补丁列表（P1）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Maps index</td><td><a href="/mw4-maps/">/mw4-maps/</a></td><td>地图/区域索引，非全图工具（P1）</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>发售 / 平台 / 模式（A）</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>发售 / 平台 / 模式入口</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">入口</th><th scope="col">Slug</th><th scope="col">一句话</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Release</td><td><a href="/mw4-release/">/mw4-release/</a></td><td>发售与时间线 FAQ</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Steam</td><td><a href="/mw4-steam/">/mw4-steam/</a></td><td>Steam / 平台购买入口说明</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Campaign</td><td><a href="/mw4-campaign/">/mw4-campaign/</a></td><td>战役概览</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Multiplayer</td><td><a href="/mw4-multiplayer/">/mw4-multiplayer/</a></td><td>多人模式概览</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Early Access</td><td><a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a></td><td>EA 资格 / 时间 / 内容边界</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Campaign EA</td><td><a href="/mw4-campaign-early-access/">/mw4-campaign-early-access/</a></td><td>战役与 EA 交叉说明</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div slot="sources" class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <caption>Sources 与更新日期</caption>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">Official MW4 DMZ</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>模式口径；EA 日历提示</td><td>confirmed</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-dmz-how-to-play-forward-operating-base-guide">FOB Full Intel Guide</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>FOB/Traits；EA 日历</td><td>confirmed</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-4"><td>4</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-ready-for-launch-progression-prestige">Ready for Launch: Progression and Prestige</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>进度与解锁口径</td><td>confirmed</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-8"><td>8</td><td>站内 B2/B3 填表增量（已验收）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>导览 Status 对齐</td><td>confirmed（站内）</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
